      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be ðon ðe mon ne ceapige buton gewytnesse.] [Ld] ⁊ þæt nan man ne dó naðor: ne ne bycgge ne ne hwyrfe, buton he borh hæbbe ⁊ gewitnysse.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no-one shall either buy or exchange anything, unless he shall have a surety and witnesses.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þæt nan man ne dó naþor: ne ne bycge ne ne hwirfe, buton he borh hæbbe ⁊ gewitnesse.</ab>
